Abbas-o-sakina Ki Hai Ataa Yeh Mashk-o-alam<br>
honge Bhi Nahi Ta'hashr Juda Yeh Mashk-o-alam<br>
<br>
1. Yeh Fouj Khuda Ki Shaan Hai<br>
<br>
yeh Pyasoun Ki Pehchaan Hai<br>
<br>
yeh Sabr-o-wafa Ji Jaan Hai<br>
<br>
hai Rounaq-e-bazm-e-aza, Yeh Mashk-o-alam<br>
<br>
<br>
2. Hain Shahid Zulm-o-jor-o-jafa<br>
<br>
yeh Jabr-o-tashadduud Par Hain Gawah<br>
<br>
har Dard-o-alam-o-gham Ko Saha<br>
<br>
bas Sabr Kiya Kiya Shukr Adaa Yeh Mashk-o-alam. <br>
<br>
<br>
3. Dariya Ke Kanare Yeh Zulm Huva<br>
<br>
zalim Ne Diya Khaimou'n Ko Hata<br>
<br>
bhai Ne Bhai Ko Dekha<br>
<br>
paani Ke Awaz Liye Pyaas Utha Yeh Mashk-o-alam<br>
<br>
<br>
4. Har Roz Izaafa Pyaas Huvi<br>
<br>
nazren Jo Mashiyyat Par Thi Jami<br>
<br>
thi Shukr Ki Khushk Labou'n Pe Tari<br>
<br>
bane Shukr-e-mujassam Sar Ta Paa Yeh Mashk-o- Alam<br>
<br>
<br>
5. Do Baazu Kate Lab-e-dariya<br>
<br>
ek Teer Mashkeez-e- Pe Laga<br>
<br>
bas Qalb-e-baali Sakina Chida<br>
<br>
har Haal Me Hai Raazi Ba Raza Yeh Mashk-o-alam<br>
<br>
<br>
6. Akbar Ke Mo'attar Woh Gesu<br>
<br>
qasim Ke Sehre Ki Qushbu<br>
<br>
har Aankh Se Nikle Banke Lahu<br>
<br>
hain Itr-e-shahadat Sar Ta Paa Yeh Mashk-o-alam<br>
<br>
<br>
7. Asghar Ki Tashna'labi Ka Gham<br>
<br>
akbar Ki Jawani Ka Matam<br>
<br>
khud Maut Ki Aankh Hai Purnam<br>
<br>
rote Hain Lahu Ankho'n Se Baha Yeh Mashk-o- Alam<br>
<br>
<br>
8. Baad-az-qatl-e-sibt-e-nabi<br>
<br>
be Waali-o-waaris Aal-e-nabi<br>
<br>
be Maqna-o-chadar Bint-e-ali<br>
<br>
dete Hain Faheem Halmin Ki Sada Yeh Mashk-o-alam